ecycle bound or implement a local scheduler fork.\\\", \\\"reviewer\\\": \\\"arch-qa\\\", \\\"rule\\\": \\\"RULE-ADR-CODE\\\", \\\"severity\\\": \\\"BLOCKING\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"OPEN\\\", \\\"verification\\\": \\\"QA3: exact native crates tree, manifests/lock and governing architecture objects are byte-identical to QA2; concrete C2 occurrence directly rechecked, original owner ID retained.\\\"}\" .\n\n<urn:beads-cache:finding:RSH-001> triage:latestReview \"C2QA4 at3282502831d33350622f56a9ddc8f5d24a4efc8a, PR109comment6608719324: remains open; no waiver.\" .\n" .
